The comments describe the two modes: `DynamicNoWorkspaces` creates workers dynamically for file URIs when no workspaces are configured, and switches behavior once workspaces are reconfigured. `DynamicWithWorkspaces` starts as `None` "until the diagnostic mode is known", then becomes a worker rooted at `file:///`.

